sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (SDK/UI)
    participant API as ml-pipeline API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP · 8887/TCP gRPC
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306/5432/TCP
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows<br/>Kubernetes API
    participant Driver as Driver (init container)<br/>In-pod
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant Cache as Cache Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Launcher as Launcher v2 (main container)<br/>In-pod
    participant S3 as MinIO/S3/GCS<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Pipeline Run Execution

    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/runs<br/>Auth: SubjectAccessReview
    API->>DB: INSERT run record<br/>Auth: DB credentials
    API->>Argo: Create Workflow<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over Argo,Launcher: Argo creates task pod with driver + launcher

    Argo->>Driver: Start init container

    Driver->>MLMD: Resolve inputs, create execution<br/>gRPC · Optional TLS
    Driver->>Cache: Check execution cache<br/>HTTPS · TLS
    Driver-->>Launcher: Pod spec patch (volume mounts, env)

    Argo->>Launcher: Start main container

    Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>S3 API · TLS 1.2+ · Cloud credentials
    Note over Launcher: Execute user code
    Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>S3 API · TLS 1.2+ · Cloud credentials
    Launcher->>MLMD: Publish execution metadata<br/>gRPC · Optional TLS

    PA->>K8s: Watch Workflow resources<br/>HTTPS · TLS 1.2+ · ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>PA: Workflow status update
    PA->>API: ReportWorkflow (gRPC)<br/>8887/TCP · Bearer token

    API-->>Client: Run status response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Scheduled Pipeline Execution

    participant SWF as Scheduled Workflow<br/>Controller

    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/recurringruns<br/>Auth: SubjectAccessReview
    API->>DB: INSERT recurring run record<br/>Auth: DB credentials

    SWF->>K8s: Watch ScheduledWorkflow CRDs<br/>HTTPS · TLS 1.2+ · ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>SWF: ScheduledWorkflow event (cron trigger)
    SWF->>API: CreateRun (gRPC)<br/>8887/TCP · Bearer token
    API->>Argo: Create Workflow<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over Argo: Workflow executes as in Flow 1
